msgstr "Project-Id-Version: OpenPINN 0.2.0\nLanguage: en\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
msgid "配置生成器"
msgstr "Method Configurator"

msgid "在下方配置问题、方法与参数，生成完整 Python 训练脚本。第一次使用可顺着流程图操作； 点击图中方框会在本页定位到对应设置或操作说明。已经熟悉流程，可直接点击“开始配置”。 如果只有自然语言问题描述，可先打开 :doc:`Understanding 网页试用 <understanding_trial>`， 查看问题草稿、缺失字段和追问，再一键填入本页的自定义 PDE/BC 编辑器。包括线弹性在内 一律进入自定义问题，不会切换到带孔板专用界面；预填不会绕过本页校验。"
msgstr "Configure the problem, method, and parameters below to generate a complete Python training script. First-time users can follow the flowchart; selecting a box moves to the corresponding setting or guidance on this page. If you already know the workflow, select Start configuring. If you only have a natural-language description, open the :doc:`Understanding Web Trial <understanding_trial>` to inspect the draft, missing fields, and questions, then apply it to this page's custom PDE/BC editor. Every family, including linear elasticity, enters the custom problem and never switches to the dedicated plate-with-hole UI; prefill does not bypass this page's validation."

msgid "Operator 脚本与带孔板教程"
msgstr "Operator scripts and the plate tutorial"

msgid "“求解路径”控件在现有 PINN 生成器旁增加了 Operator 路径。"
msgstr "The solution-path control adds an Operator path next to the existing PINN generator."

msgid "**Operator** 将注册表驱动的模型（目前为 DeepONet 或 FNO）与 ``data_only``、``physics_only`` 和 ``hybrid`` 训练模式分开选择。PINO 不是模型选项或预设。 控制方程下拉框只提供自定义问题；选择一维或二维后，使用与 PINN 路径相同的几何、PDE、 边界和预览控件。下载的文件会保留完整的 ``PDEProblem``，并调用 ``build_operator_config`` 和 ``train_operator_problem``。物理模式会针对设计的残差及其边界条件或 初始条件训练，不会替换为目录中的 smoke 问题，也不会调用 ``solve``。``data_only`` 和 ``hybrid`` 需要单独配置训练观测 CSV（启用、路径以及列和尺度映射），``physics_only`` 会隐藏该入口。 所有模式都可另行配置可选的训练后参考 CSV；它可以使用不同文件和列映射，并由 ``evaluate_operator_reference_csv`` 评估，关闭时跳过评估。页面不会让两个 CSV 角色互相替代， 也不会上传文件。折叠的高级区域会把来自组件注册表的 derivative、sampler 和 optimizer 选择写入 生成脚本。内置 Poisson、Burgers、隧道和带孔板案例仍属于教程，而不是 Operator 路径的控制方程选项。"
msgstr "**Operator** separates the registry-driven model (currently DeepONet or FNO) from the ``data_only``, ``physics_only``, and ``hybrid`` training modes. PINO is not a model option or preset. The governing-equation dropdown is custom-only; choose one or two dimensions, then use the same geometry, PDE, boundary, and preview controls as the PINN path. The downloaded file preserves the complete ``PDEProblem`` and calls ``build_operator_config`` and ``train_operator_problem``. Physics modes train on the designed residual and its boundary or initial conditions; they do not substitute a catalog smoke problem and do not call ``solve``. ``data_only`` and ``hybrid`` require a separate training-observation CSV with enable, path, column, and scale settings; ``physics_only`` hides that entry. Every mode can also configure an optional post-train reference CSV with a different file and column map, evaluated by ``evaluate_operator_reference_csv``; leaving it off skips evaluation. The page never substitutes one CSV role for the other and never uploads either file. A collapsed advanced section records derivative, sampler, and optimizer choices from the component registries in the generated script. Built-in Poisson, Burgers, tunnel, and plate cases remain tutorials rather than Operator-path governing-equation choices."

msgid "校验失败时，复制和下载保持禁用。页面不会替换为其他 Operator、问题、物理模型或 PINN 方法。 请从仓库根目录运行文件，例如 ``python examples/deeponet_config.py``。训练发生在该进程中， 而不是浏览器中。"
msgstr "Copy and download stay disabled when validation fails. The page does not substitute another Operator, problem, physics model, or PINN method. Run the file from the repository root, for example ``python examples/deeponet_config.py``. Training happens in that process, not in the browser."

msgid "二维带孔板示例不再是配置器的求解路径。它仍作为受支持且可发现的 :doc:`plate_with_hole_demo` 保留，运行方式为 ``examples/plate_with_hole.py --smoke``；其代码生成、Kirsch 对比和测试仍在仓库中。"
msgstr "The 2D plate-with-hole example is no longer a configurator solution path. It remains a supported, discoverable :doc:`plate_with_hole_demo` using ``examples/plate_with_hole.py --smoke``; its code generation, Kirsch comparison, and tests remain in the repository."

msgid "需要超出固定方程项的表达能力时，使用展开后的公式与物理参数编辑器。界面只显示未知场、 参数和公式，不再显示模板或字段预设入口。可以编辑单场公式、从常见物理参数库添加参数、定义自有参数、填写数值与单位， 并导入/导出本地扩展库和方程快照。生成代码内嵌参数与表达式树，调用 ``op.make_physics_residual``，不是只把公式写进注释。 支持单场孔压扩散、稳态 Darcy 水头和热扩散等示例；示例值不是材料推荐值。 具体语法、单位、边界含义及新增参数的协作流程见 :doc:`physics_library`。 原来的“自由组合”改名为“按项组合（兼容旧版）”，已有用法保持可用。"
msgstr "For equations beyond the fixed terms, use the expanded formula and physics-parameter editor. Its visible interface contains only the unknown field, parameters, and formula, without template or field-preset controls. You can edit a scalar-field formula, add common or custom parameters with values and units, and import or export extension libraries and equation snapshots. Generated code embeds the parameters and expression tree and calls ``op.make_physics_residual``. It supports examples such as scalar pore-pressure diffusion, steady Darcy head, and heat diffusion; example values are not material recommendations. See :doc:`physics_library` for syntax, units, boundary meaning, and parameter collaboration. The former Free combination mode remains available as Term composition (legacy)."
